LineComment   "// numeric is a bound: twice may call a.add(a). The integers impl numeric;"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// string, which has only concatenation, does not — so twice would reject a"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// string argument, the contract doing exactly the work a concrete-type signature"
Newline       "\n"
LineComment   "// could not."
Newline       "\n"
